"""Fixed terminal explanations and refusals from wireless attendants."""
ROWS = []
def add(key, labels, subject, lines):
    replies = [line.strip() for line in lines.split('|')]
    assert len(replies) == 11, (key, len(replies))
    ROWS.append(dict(key='hoenn_wireless_' + key, labels=labels.split(), subject=subject, replies=replies))

add('club_explained','CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClub','An attendant explains the Union Room, Direct Corner, nearby connections and cable alternative, then ends the conversation.','''soft_smile~Two rooms, several things to do, and one very patient explainer. We have directions now.|A clear distinction between the rooms and their connection requirements.|Pick what we want to do before choosing the room.|I appreciate being told how it works before having to try.|A little preparation will make meeting up much easier.|Our social expedition has acquired both a floor plan and some practical instructions.|An admirably thorough defense against wandering into the wrong room.|Clear room functions and a useful troubleshooting step. Good explanation.|Knowing how to meet can leave more room to enjoy the company.|A well explained arrangement makes a new place feel less awkward.|I would check where our friends plan to go before choosing a room.''')
add('club_no_explanation','CableClub_Text_HopeYouEnjoyWirelessSystem','An attendant accepts declining the explanation and wishes an enjoyable visit.','''soft_smile~We can skip the explanation and keep the friendly send-off. Nice.|The information remains available if we discover we need it.|We know enough for now. Good to know we can ask.|I like not being made to listen when I am already ready.|A warm welcome can be brief and still feel thoughtful.|The optional lecture has gracefully become an uncomplicated good wish.|Our existing knowledge has been permitted to survive without another introduction.|We can try it and return with specific questions if needed.|A kind wish is a pleasant thing to carry into a gathering.|A gracious response that leaves us comfortable choosing for ourselves.|I hope everyone gets the chance to enjoy meeting their friends here.''')
add('union_adapter_missing','CableClub_Text_UnionRoomAdapterNotConnected','The Union Room attendant says the Wireless Adapter is not properly connected and invites a return.','''flustered~The room is ready, but our connection is not. Time to check the little attachment.|The adapter connection is the stated problem. We should inspect that first.|Check the adapter. This attempt is finished.|At least they were kind about pointing out the problem.|We can fix the setup before asking to try again.|Our arrival has encountered one small but essential missing connection.|The invitation is open. The hardware is being considerably less sociable.|A clear fault to investigate is better than guessing at the whole system.|A small adjustment may let a postponed meeting begin.|An inconvenient detail, delivered with decent manners.|I would make sure the adapter is fitted properly before we return.''')
